    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Also recommended for you:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/66ac9011c0325278733f892a09ec4db1.avif?t=1642161472\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.poster.avif?t=1642161472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.webm?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.mp4?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In <strong>Snowyland</strong> you should <strong>freeze</strong> a member of your family to <strong>create ice platforms</strong> that helps you to <strong>reach the meat</strong> at the end of the level. You can <strong>choose where</strong> the ice platform is placed, meaning that each player has an <strong>unique experience</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.poster.avif?t=1642161472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.webm?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.mp4?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Many Levels</strong> - Snowyland has more than 45 levels, your family must explore and find  new ingredients for your dinner.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Alternative Paths</strong> - Certain levels allow for a varied solution, it's up to you to decide the number of sacrifices.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Hidden Items</strong> - Find hidden vegetables around the levels to make your dinner even more delicious!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/7d339a46b2e82842c102cd6d5144f194.avif?t=1642161472\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/66ac9011c0325278733f892a09ec4db1.avif?t=1642161472\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.poster.avif?t=1642161472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.webm?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/70a154bbec513c7e6a72c00301dfd861.mp4?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In <strong>Snowyland</strong> you should <strong>freeze</strong> a member of your family to <strong>create ice platforms</strong> that helps you to <strong>reach the meat</strong> at the end of the level. You can <strong>choose where</strong> the ice platform is placed, meaning that each player has an <strong>unique experience</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.poster.avif?t=1642161472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.webm?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/cef5d776ee31bda025b820917ef2b646.mp4?t=1642161472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Many Levels</strong> - Snowyland has more than 45 levels, your family must explore and find  new ingredients for your dinner.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Alternative Paths</strong> - Certain levels allow for a varied solution, it's up to you to decide the number of sacrifices.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Hidden Items</strong> - Find hidden vegetables around the levels to make your dinner even more delicious!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731730/extras/7d339a46b2e82842c102cd6d5144f194.avif?t=1642161472\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Snowyland is a pixel art platformer where the player must eat to survive on an empty, barren island. You should freeze family members to create ice platforms that help you reach your dinner. Choose where this ice platforms are placed, and create solutions that even the developers have not seen yet!",
